  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "無線網路系統",
    "sub_ename": "IEEE802 WIRELESS SYSTEMS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹無線通訊與網路的基礎觀念，主要講授無線網路實體層、資料鏈結層與網路層技術，並介紹無線廣域網路、區域網路、隨身網路之架構設計與標準，課程也將讓同學學習以開源工具模擬與分析無線網路行為。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces fundamental concepts of wireless communications and networks. The lectures mainly cover the physical, data link, and network layers of modern wireless technologies, and introduce the designs and standards of wireless WAN, LAN, and PAN. Students participating this course will also learn how to analyze and/or simulate the behavior of wireless networks using open source tools.",
    "pre_subname": "IECS2004通訊與網路概論",
    "pre_sub_id3": "IECS2004",
    "pre_sub_ename": "IECS2004 INTRODUCTION TO NETWORK COMMUNICATION",
    "pre_describe": null,
